('advanced-native-1214', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1214-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rooms involve different drawbacks that need to be weighed for the activity."],"options":["The speaker is mainly concerned that the written answer looks untidy.","The quiet room had enough seats, but the members rejected it because it was too far away.","The larger room solved the seating problem, and noise was not part of the comparison.","The rooms involve different drawbacks that need to be weighed for the activity."]},"advanced-native-1214-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Each option solved one problem while creating another.","A quick choice would have hidden a trade-off the members should discuss.","There was no neat answer because quietness and capacity pointed to different rooms.","I needed to know which drawback mattered for the activity."],"options":["Each option solved one problem while creating another.","A quick choice would have hidden a trade-off the members should discuss.","There was no neat answer because quietness and capacity pointed to different rooms.","I needed to know which drawback mattered for the activity."]},"advanced-native-1214-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["There is no neat answer that reduces her choice to only one cause."],"options":["The job offer is the main explanation, so the family passages can be treated as background without examining them.","The character’s private wishes should be treated separately, without asking how they connect to the job and family expectations.","There is no neat answer that reduces her choice to only one cause."]},"advanced-native-1214-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["No relevant evidence can help us choose any action."],"options":["No relevant evidence can help us choose any action.","A simple response may leave important considerations unresolved.","Careful comparison may still support a workable next step."]},"advanced-native-1214-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["There is no nea