('advanced-native-1215', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1215-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It established a clearer criterion for comparing designs without settling every layout."],"options":["It established a clearer criterion for comparing designs without settling every layout.","It chose one final layout before any testing was needed.","It replaced the visitors’ understanding with the designers’ favourite colours as the main aim.","The group now had no reason to compare the remaining layouts."]},"advanced-native-1215-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had a firmer sense of what the design was meant to achieve.","We gained a clearer compass for judging the signs.","We could ask whether each layout helped a visitor understand the first instruction.","The discussion gave us a shared criterion for the next tests."],"options":["We had a firmer sense of what the design was meant to achieve.","We gained a clearer compass for judging the signs.","We could ask whether each layout helped a visitor understand the first instruction.","The discussion gave us a shared criterion for the next tests."]},"advanced-native-1215-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["That principle gives us a clearer compass for selecting the interview passages."],"options":["That principle gives us a clearer compass for selecting the interview passages.","The new principle makes relevance less important than keeping the interviews evenly represented.","We should now keep whichever passage is longest, regardless of its relevance."]},"advanced-native-1215-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every practical decision has already been made correctly."],"options":["The context should say which guiding principle became clearer.","The person has a better-defined basis for making choices.","Every practical decision has already been made correctly."]},"advanced-native-1215-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We have a clearer compass, but we still need to test which layout serves that aim best.