('advanced-native-1219', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1219-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Clarifying the term prevented people from acting on a misunderstood instruction."],"options":["Clarifying the term prevented people from acting on a misunderstood instruction.","It was the latest possible minute on the programme, regardless of what guests understood.","The interpreter was only revising notes after every guest had already left.","The interpreter’s useful clarification came during the rehearsal, while the live confusion remained unresolved."]},"advanced-native-1219-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The timely explanation connected the unfamiliar term with the action people were about to take.","People needed to understand before following the instruction.","She caught a misunderstanding at a point when it could affect what guests did next.","She helped when it mattered most, before the wrong action was taken."],"options":["The timely explanation connected the unfamiliar term with the action people were about to take.","People needed to understand before following the instruction.","She caught a misunderstanding at a point when it could affect what guests did next.","She helped when it mattered most, before the wrong action was taken."]},"advanced-native-1219-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She spoke up when it mattered most, while there was still time to correct the signs."],"options":["Her comment mattered only because she waited until no one could change the signs.","She was discussing a past event with no effect on tonight’s arrangements.","She spoke up when it mattered most, while there was still time to correct the signs."]},"advanced-native-1219-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The phrase must mean the last minute, whether or not anything important depends on it."],"options":["An action may be valuable because it occurs before a consequential choice.","The context identifies a particularly consequential moment.","The phrase must mean the last minute, whether or not anything important depends on it."]},"advanced-native-1219-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Helping when it matters most is about the importance of the moment, not waiting as long as possible."],"options":["Then the same help would matter most at the end of the programme, even if the guests had already chosen what to do.","I took it to mean the most impressive part of her speech, rather than the moment the guests needed clarification.","Helping when it matters most is about the importance of the moment, not waiting as long as possible."]},"advanced-native-1219-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You listened when it mattered most, while I was deciding whether to return to the course. Thank you for helping me sort out my reasons without choosing for me.","Your patient questions helped when it mattered most: I needed to understand what returning would mean to me. I made the decision myself, but I appreciated having you beside me."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1220', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1220-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group followed a defined repeated schedule despite suggestions to change the start."],"options":["Each morning’s work began at a different unplanned time.","The visitors replaced the routine with their later starting time every day.","The group followed a defined repeated schedule despite suggestions to change the start.","The group only wrote a timetable and never followed its sequence."]},"advanced-native-1220-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We stuck to a strict routine for that recording week.","We continued with the sequence we had agreed.","The later-start suggestion did not change the timetable we followed.","We kept the equipment check, opening rehearsal and correction time as arranged."],"options":["We stuck to a strict routine for that recording week.","We continued with the sequence we had agreed.","The later-start suggestion did not change the timetable we followed.","We kept the equipment check, opening rehearsal and correction time as arranged."]},"advanced-native-1220-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She has stuck to a strict routine for closing the workshop."],"options":["She has only suggested a sequence that no one has tried yet.","Her closing tasks change at random, with no repeated order.","She has stuck to a strict routine for closing the workshop."]},"advanced-native-1220-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Following the routine alone proves it is the best plan for everyone."],"options":["The person follows a defined repeated plan closely.","Following the routine alone proves it is the best plan for everyone.","Whether the routine works well needs evidence beyond the fact of following it."]},"advanced-native-1220-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We stuck to a strict routine, but we still need to listen to the recordings before judging the result."],"options":["Since we kept the routine, perhaps the remaining problem must be with