('advanced-native-1221', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1221-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker cared about the work but lacked mental energy for another demanding comparison."],"options":["The speaker had recovered enough concentration to begin another detailed comparison that evening.","The speaker cared about the work but lacked mental energy for another demanding comparison.","The speaker was bored with the story itself rather than tired by the effort of comparing accounts.","The speaker wanted a simpler explanation only because the account was unfamiliar, before doing any comparison."]},"advanced-native-1221-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I still wanted to be fair to the story but could not give it careful attention then.","The previous comparisons had used up my mental energy that evening.","I felt mentally drained and needed a pause before another demanding task.","Postponing it would give me another chance to read with proper concentration."],"options":["I still wanted to be fair to the story but could not give it careful attention then.","The previous comparisons had used up my mental energy that evening.","I felt mentally drained and needed a pause before another demanding task.","Postponing it would give me another chance to read with proper concentration."]},"advanced-native-1221-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She feels mentally drained after giving so much attention to everyone’s concerns."],"options":["She needs more facts about the options before she can begin the evening’s discussion.","She feels mentally drained after giving so much attention to everyone’s concerns.","She has chosen the new arrangement and now wants the family to stop comparing it with alternatives."]},"advanced-native-1221-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The person must have permanently lost the ability to think about that topic."],"options":["The person must have permanently lost the ability to think about that topic.","A later attempt may need a