('advanced-native-1223', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1223-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The work had enjoyable parts as well as practical difficulties."],"options":["The costumes were the main source of difficulty, while scheduling the groups was straightforward.","The speaker enjoyed guiding but had already solved the problems caused by late groups and room changes.","The speaker had already decided to stop giving any future tours.","The work had enjoyable parts as well as practical difficulties."]},"advanced-native-1223-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The rewarding parts came with some awkward practical problems.","Some days were harder because groups arrived late or rooms changed.","I enjoyed the costumes, but the changing arrangements could be demanding.","It was not always a bed of roses, even though there was plenty I loved."],"options":["The rewarding parts came with some awkward practical problems.","Some days were harder because groups arrived late or rooms changed.","I enjoyed the costumes, but the changing arrangements could be demanding.","It was not always a bed of roses, even though there was plenty I loved."]},"advanced-native-1223-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Running the studio is not always a bed of roses, though he still values the work."],"options":["Running the studio is not always a bed of roses, though he still values the work.","He values making the albums, but has decided that the delivery difficulties mean he should close the studio now.","He is discussing only the enjoyable design stage, not the revision and delivery work."]},"advanced-native-1223-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The person never experiences any satisfaction in the situation."],"options":["The speaker may be correcting an overly easy picture of the experience.","The situation can involve difficulties despite enjoyable aspects.","The person never experiences any satisfaction in the situation."]},"advanced-native-1223-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","an