('advanced-native-1226', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1226-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The exhibition was exciting, while the old teacher’s opinion also made it personally worrying."],"options":["The exhibition was exciting, while the old teacher’s opinion also made it personally worrying.","The worry concerned visitor numbers, rather than the teacher’s response.","The teacher had already reviewed every drawing before the speaker felt excited.","The exhibition had finished, and the speaker was packing the drawings away."]},"advanced-native-1226-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The teacher’s visit made the public event feel personally significant.","My excitement was wrapped up with how much my old teacher’s opinion mattered to me.","I wanted to share the drawings, but I cared deeply about one visitor’s response.","Showing the work also meant letting someone important to me judge it."],"options":["The teacher’s visit made the public event feel personally significant.","My excitement was wrapped up with how much my old teacher’s opinion mattered to me.","I wanted to share the drawings, but I cared deeply about one visitor’s response.","Showing the work also meant letting someone important to me judge it."]},"advanced-native-1226-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her excitement about moving was wrapped up with sadness about leaving their shared mornings."],"options":["Her excitement about moving was wrapped up with sadness about leaving their shared mornings.","She felt sad only because the new flat had already been rented to somebody else.","She had decided to cancel the move and keep every part of her old routine."]},"advanced-native-1226-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["主持人結束會議，請大家離場。"],"options":["一項期待與在意某人的反應連在一起。","兩個問題在這個人的經驗中互相牽連。","主持人結束會議，請大家離場。"]},"advanced-native-1226-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I do want the exhibition; the excitement is wrapped up with caring about her response."],"options":["I do want the exhibition; the