('advanced-native-1227', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1227-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The surprise of two friends recognising each other, rather than a complete record of the reunion."],"options":["The planned pose that everyone held for the official group picture.","The gate’s measurements so that the school could rebuild it.","Every person and conversation across the whole reunion.","The surprise of two friends recognising each other, rather than a complete record of the reunion."]},"advanced-native-1227-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The expression on their faces mattered more to this sketch than including everybody.","I was keeping a brief encounter rather than documenting the whole event.","I wanted to capture the moment when they recognised each other.","Their surprise was the part of the reunion I especially wanted to remember."],"options":["The expression on their faces mattered more to this sketch than including everybody.","I was keeping a brief encounter rather than documenting the whole event.","I wanted to capture the moment when they recognised each other.","Their surprise was the part of the reunion I especially wanted to remember."]},"advanced-native-1227-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The later photograph recreates her reaction; it does not capture the moment when she first heard the news."],"options":["The later pose records the very first reaction exactly as it happened.","The later pose can be used as direct evidence of her spontaneous expression before the camera was ready.","The later photograph recreates her reaction; it does not capture the moment when she first heard the news."]},"advanced-native-1227-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["作品必定完整而不經選擇地記下整個活動。"],"options":["作品必定完整而不經選擇地記下整個活動。","作者可說明自己選擇了哪個細節。","影像或文字想保留某一刻的感覺。"]},"advanced-native-1227-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is complete for what I wanted: I was trying to capture the moment you recognised your friend."],"options":["I could add more fa