('advanced-native-1231', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1231-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["An uncertain response to unfinished writing that the speaker chose to share."],"options":["The speaker’s inability to hear any response because the group had left.","A certainty that every listener would misunderstand the ending, rather than an uncertain possibility.","An uncertain response to unfinished writing that the speaker chose to share.","A guaranteed positive review already written by every listener."]},"advanced-native-1231-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I cared about an ending that the group might read differently.","Sharing something unfinished left me uncertain about their reaction.","I wanted their response even though I could not decide in advance what it would be.","There was a sharp edge of risk in hearing an honest first response I could not control."],"options":["I cared about an ending that the group might read differently.","Sharing something unfinished left me uncertain about their reaction.","I wanted their response even though I could not decide in advance what it would be.","There was a sharp edge of risk in hearing an honest first response I could not control."]},"advanced-native-1231-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The sharp edge of risk lay in changing a piece she valued without being able to restore the old pattern."],"options":["The sharp edge of risk lay in changing a piece she valued without being able to restore the old pattern.","She was describing only how sharp the carving tool looked, not the possible loss of the original design.","The risk was choosing which pattern to preserve on paper, rather than changing the exhibition piece itself."]},"advanced-native-1231-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["這個意象本身已計出失敗的準確機率。"],"options":["這個意象本身已計出失敗的準確機率。","作者可用具體情況解釋緊張感。","某種重要的未知後果令感受鮮明。"]},"advanced-native-1231-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["That sharp edge of risk is real for me, but I still want to hear how the endin